        "content": [
          "To become a member, start the process at 8:00 am and then empty the mailbox.",
          "Check if the mailbox is empty",
          "if not",
          "continue the process.",
          "Check if the mailbox is empty again",
          "Verify if the information is complete.",
          "make a telephone call to the sender.",
          "complete the data by adding the incoming mail number, date, and record it in the letter book.",
          "Every Wednesday evening",
          "take the letter book and member register to Miranda.",
          "If the applicant becomes a member",
          "stamp \"new Member\" on the letter and write the date on it.",
          "write the data.",
          "Simultaneously,",
          "calculate the fee",
          "Ask Charles to write the amount in the register.",
          "Print the membership card with all the data and send it to the new member.",
          "The process ends."
        ]
